  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon the Movie 2000 opened in US cinemas on 21 July 2000, and as with the first film, select theaters gave away exclusive cards: Moltres, Articuno and Zapdos, Wizards Black Star Promos 21 to 23, the legendary birds at the heart of its story. Naoyo Kimura drew all three, but most copies credit Toshinao Aoki; the credit was corrected only late in the film's run, so the copies with Kimura's name are much scarcer.",
